      "content": "i just don't see how there's any way to go back from this. the damage is done. i'm already a ghost to them, just a disappointment they have to deal with now. i keep thinking about how much better it would be if they could just remember the version of me that actually made them proud. instead of seeing me fail over and over, they could just have that one perfect memory of me. isn't there any dignity in just stopping before things get any messier?",
